    bottomLine: "The current NordicTrack closest to what the C950i was: a folding 60-inch iFIT treadmill at a mid-range price.",
    description: "The T Series 10 is NordicTrack’s current mid-range folding treadmill. In our October 2026 T Series review NordicTrack and independent sources agreed on a 20 by 60-inch belt, a 3.0 CHP motor (NordicTrack’s rating), 0 to 12 mph, 0 to 12% incline, a 325 lb rating and a 10-inch tilting touchscreen. It runs current iFIT software, which needs a paid membership for classes and automatic speed and incline control. We could not read NordicTrack’s price on 5 November 2026, so check it on the day.",
  },
  {
    id: "nordictrack-commercial-1250",
    name: "NordicTrack Commercial 1250",
    brand: "NordicTrack",
    category: "Sturdier Current Step-Up",
    badge: "Step Up",
